    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Lost Runners</strong> is a cooperative survival-horror experience that challenges you and your friends to confront your deepest fears. Every environment is fraught with danger, mystery, and unexpected twists. Only through seamless teamwork and careful attention to detail can you survive and unravel the secrets of the Backrooms. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/eb0cf85c943a0a4c8123d800d7c7d398.avif?t=1755120576\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong><br>Venture through dimly lit corridors with dynamic lighting and realistic sound design. In this world, every footstep\u2014and every whisper\u2014could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Logic Puzzles</strong><br>Engage with a variety of puzzles built around electrical circuits, switches, and ciphers. Each challenge adapts to your team\u2019s approach and demands inventive problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique entities that react to sound, light, and movement. Some monsters hone in on your voice; others lurk silently in the dark. Learn their behavior to stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your mental state: staying near heat sources or conserving flashlight power slows sanity loss. Let panic take over, and you\u2019ll face hallucinations that turn survival into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tesseract Afterlife</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning. Enter a surreal Tesseract realm where teammates can revive you\u2014or you can find your own way back to the living world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Cooperative Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on collaboration. Share scarce resources, coordinate tactics via voice chat, and make collective choices that shape the unfolding story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/8f24afd3d2101e51d89e5b0884e85a65.avif?t=1755120576\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Linear Story &amp; Quest System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover scattered journals, audio logs, and flash drives to piece together the catastrophe\u2019s timeline. Every decision you make influences the narrative and leads to multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/d13f5e05bc8d0c269d6ff54dbb20c287.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/d13f5e05bc8d0c269d6ff54dbb20c287.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/d13f5e05bc8d0c269d6ff54dbb20c287.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management &amp; Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for food, clothing, and tools to maintain health, stamina, and sanity. Will you risk venturing alone for high-value loot, or stick close to your squad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find valuable items and resources by exploring camps, lockers, and shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a0657f96a9e8e7f9f2cc533532034118.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a0657f96a9e8e7f9f2cc533532034118.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/a0657f96a9e8e7f9f2cc533532034118.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware zero-gravity zones, sudden teleportation rifts, and shifting walls. In the Backrooms, the laws of physics are your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>YOUR ADVENTURE IS JUST BEGINNING.</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98e65517cdbc52a9132218eaca46db67.avif?t=1755120576\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Add to Your Wishlist?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: Lost Runners blends heart-pounding horror, brain-teasing puzzles, and rich cooperative gameplay into a continuously evolving adventure. With new maps, creatures, and storylines planned, adding the game to your wishlist ensures you\u2019ll be among the first to receive exclusive launch rewards and update announcements.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Lost Runners</strong> is a cooperative survival-horror experience that challenges you and your friends to confront your deepest fears. Every environment is fraught with danger, mystery, and unexpected twists. Only through seamless teamwork and careful attention to detail can you survive and unravel the secrets of the Backrooms. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/eb0cf85c943a0a4c8123d800d7c7d398.avif?t=1755120576\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong><br>Venture through dimly lit corridors with dynamic lighting and realistic sound design. In this world, every footstep\u2014and every whisper\u2014could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Logic Puzzles</strong><br>Engage with a variety of puzzles built around electrical circuits, switches, and ciphers. Each challenge adapts to your team\u2019s approach and demands inventive problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/2e4fa5377f719beb2f4c6d6a419caa1d.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique entities that react to sound, light, and movement. Some monsters hone in on your voice; others lurk silently in the dark. Learn their behavior to stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98b2a50f17c407297b718c5c2377957a.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your mental state: staying near heat sources or conserving flashlight power slows sanity loss. Let panic take over, and you\u2019ll face hallucinations that turn survival into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tesseract Afterlife</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning. Enter a surreal Tesseract realm where teammates can revive you\u2014or you can find your own way back to the living world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/697341d2ff2b49f9d7dae0092f0042d7.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Cooperative Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on collaboration. Share scarce resources, coordinate tactics via voice chat, and make collective choices that shape the unfolding story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/8f24afd3d2101e51d89e5b0884e85a65.avif?t=1755120576\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Linear Story &amp; Quest System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover scattered journals, audio logs, and flash drives to piece together the catastrophe\u2019s timeline. Every decision you make influences the narrative and leads to multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/7cc03faca2b7fa3e7890bb2bd9d0bff9.webm