\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware zero-gravity zones, sudden teleportation rifts, and shifting walls. In the Backrooms, the laws of physics are your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.poster.avif?t=1755120576\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.webm?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/fbc59e4b979bfa989b7c8e94f2f66f62.mp4?t=1755120576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>YOUR ADVENTURE IS JUST BEGINNING.</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072120/extras/98e65517cdbc52a9132218eaca46db67.avif?t=1755120576\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Add to Your Wishlist?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: Lost Runners blends heart-pounding horror, brain-teasing puzzles, and rich cooperative gameplay into a continuously evolving adventure. With new maps, creatures, and storylines planned, adding the game to your wishlist ensures you\u2019ll be among the first to receive exclusive launch rewards and update announcements.</p>",
